{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國紐約曼哈頓一個地鐵站上周六（17日）發生槍擊案，一名男子死亡，疑兇在逃。</p><p>紐約警方表示，槍擊案發生在E線第七大道與53街交會處地鐵站月台。</p><p>警方接報到場，發現一名男子胸部中槍，該男子送院後確認死亡。</p><p>事件疑由爭執引致，目前警方仍在調查中。</p><p>（綜合）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T07:18:46.946190+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T06:34:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:17:44.678558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T07:17:31.821263+00:00","content_hash":"f3fde30f1c4fdf660a71b3d28f4e37d0bfb01402830129870ddf8000d99a79f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}